Package: fuxi-firmware
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: fuxi port <noreply@localhost>
Section: non-free-firmware/kernel
Priority: optional
Description: Xiaomi 13 (fuxi, SM8550) firmware (proprietary, locally built)
 Firmware loaded by the mainline kernel and services on the Xiaomi 13:
 modem / modem_pr / IPA / ADSP / GPU zap under qcom/sm8550/xiaomi/fuxi,
 Adreno 740 SQE + GMU, the AudioReach topology, WCN7850 WiFi (ath12k) and
 Bluetooth (qca). Built on the host from the phone's own copies by
 scripts/fuxi-firmware-pull.sh; never redistributed. The per-file sha256
 and origin (an Android partition, or local) is in
 /usr/share/fuxi-firmware/PROVENANCE.txt.
